Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:10.40,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:15.86,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.90,0:01:18.62,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The flag that called forth oaths{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:21.33,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}chikai atsumeta hata{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Keep fighting on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.37,0:01:24.08,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tatakai tsudukete iku{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stay true to yourself{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:28.83,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"jibunjishin" tsuranuke{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seize it, dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:33.17,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}tsukami toru Dreamin' on{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't lose, I'll never run away{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:38.55,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}makerarenai nige ya shinai{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Transcend meetings and partings and keep going{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.22,0:01:42.06,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}deai wakare koe ikou{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're all treasures{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.10,0:01:46.39,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}zenbu takaramono{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:49.60,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:52.73,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:57.45,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.49,0:02:01.58,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.69,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden transformed the lawless land of Kuri\Ninto a habitable place,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and was given the title of the Daimyo of Kuri\Nby Kozuki Sukiyaki, the Shogun at the time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Out at sea, there must be\Nextraordinary things that are beyond my imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna experience the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We climbed up the falls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there sea and an island here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a problem, Kanjuro-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.14,0:03:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, you're too loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.62,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a report\Nthat a pirate ship docked at Itachi Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.57,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}! Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.64,0:03:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.70,0:03:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll go get food and supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.37,0:03:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't. You're an apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops! Can I go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,--{\i1}All right! Let's go!{\i0}\N--Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no apprentices allowed!\NStay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.55,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} went to the port?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.06,0:04:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you let him go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a pirate ship at Itachi Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's not like the other ships!\N--They say it's big and the pirates look tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He just went to chase them away, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.41,0:04:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I am sure that you are aware of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.03,0:04:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that it?! A pirate ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.21,0:04:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.13,0:04:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, back off, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.26,0:04:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone out of the ordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Through bad weather and up the falls,\NI'm glad that you made it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.89,0:05:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Oden's Determination!\NWhitebeard's Test!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You stopped my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man! You're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.09,0:06:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he ridicule Pops!\NI'll make him pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The rumor is true, they are pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's underestimating me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for someone like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,\Nbut let me ride...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.74,0:07:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...on your ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.96,0:07:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden Two-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.71,0:07:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Paradise Waterfall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.32,0:08:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.35,0:08:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think he is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.85,0:08:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the Daimyo of Kuri, Kozuki Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know the consequences of\Npointing a sword at him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a Daimyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You damn pirates! Get out of this country now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.26,0:09:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you! I'll make you regret...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...messing with the Whitebeard Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.81,0:09:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna explore the world! It's my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.61,0:09:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's set sail together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.37,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna leave this restrictive land!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the free world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}! Raise your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried to kill our captain, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! He is a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a nuisance!\NGet out of this country now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But our ship was wrecked on the way here\Nand we can't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a shame! Let's repair it quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! If you stay here, Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} will...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.37,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Repair it immediately and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we will do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Carry it there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You-{\i1}gara{\i0} guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, help yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s special {\i1}oden{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden{\i0} wouldn't be {\i1}oden{\i0} if it wasn't boiled!\NHere!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.83,0:10:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like it, Whitebeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:11:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never tasted something quite like this!\NSo this is the taste of a foreign country!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alcohol made from grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There are tons of things that I don't know,\Naren't there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the world that I've never seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the type to serve under someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you come on board...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--When selfish people like you come together...\N--Thump!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...what will happen to a team?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned it the hard way\Nin my previous pirate group.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.35,0:11:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could do that, I'd already have done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.70,0:11:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried dozens of times, but I failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have zero skill at navigating a ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:12:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Then give it up and do your job as a Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This country is so restrictive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it! Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.68,0:12:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano has a law\Nthat strictly bars people from leaving the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} is now the Daimyo of Kuri,\Nso it would be inexcusable for him to break the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.54,0:12:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell him about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good to know!\NWe're like-minded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of taking Oden, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.35,0:12:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about the national laws!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.81,0:12:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden, you still have some work to do here,\Ndon't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.61,0:12:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.23,0:12:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} is an indispensable person in Kuri\Nand the whole Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me aboard your ship, Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This country is so restrictive!\NI don't wanna go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Untie me! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.56,0:13:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.77,0:13:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.71,0:13:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Five islands in the world?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's totally wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than 10 or 20 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There are that many?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.31,0:13:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventures are fun! You must be interested!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.07,0:14:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The world is big!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can count how many islands there are!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:28.65,On Top,,0,0,0,,TWO WEEKS LATER
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Moby Dick's repairs are complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.91,0:14:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Izo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--Where are you going, Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}?\N--You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That may be so but where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go to the bathroom whenever I want!\NI thought I was a Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry... The night can be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.52,0:15:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I feel bad for Oden,\Nbut we had to sneak away at night.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.02,0:15:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering his strength,\Nhe may have been an asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.28,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Pops kind of liked him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I took a liking to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.25,0:15:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,it's akin to kidnapping royalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There'd be hell to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you leave the treasure chest as thanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.01,0:15:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave us food and timber...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you would do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.99,0:16:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me on board the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}! I knew {\i1}you{\i0} would do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.67,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me come!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back! You are the next Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.53,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, Oden! Give it up and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,--Wait, Marco!\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring in the one who came after him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hold onto the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no time for you to worry about others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're flying over the falls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Why did you save me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0} is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.23,0:17:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard's ship left the port, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Izo...\NDog-{\i1}chan{\i0} and Cat-{\i1}chan{\i0} are gone, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Okiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of fearing the worst,\Nlet's look for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,--Okay?!\N--Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Search! Search across the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Whitebeard! Pull in Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!\NHe will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.05,0:18:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He carries the future of the Land of Wano\Non his shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw me turning him down\Nmany times, right, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.77,0:18:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But he still left the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll play by our own rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't just take in a dangerous guy like him\Nand put my family in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna stop him,\Nyou need to convince him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.05,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.53,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hang onto that chain for three days,\NI'll welcome you on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.93,0:18:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure, Whitebeard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you have my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get on board that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.88,0:19:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Oden still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:20:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But he looks terrible...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.01,0:20:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His face is swollen beyond recognition\Nfrom the collisions and the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it's gonna burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.37,0:20:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,An hour to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why are you cheering him on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if he pulls this off,\Nhe'll join us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden will become our crewmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden will become our crewmate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang tough, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you\Nfor giving my lord such a hard time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.28,0:21:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden, keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.62,0:21:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oden!\N--A little more to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.91,0:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.79,0:21:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go! Do not touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:29.18,On Top,,0,0,0,,AMATSUKI TOKI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Very classy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.98,0:21:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you running, you tramp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take you to the Land of Wano\Nby ship like you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here! We don't wanna hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a slave ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.08,0:21:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hurt me, my price will go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe I was fooled\Nby you evil-looking miscreants!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.05,0:22:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only the sea behind you!\NYou have nowhere to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.51,0:22:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have a place to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.04,0:22:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The only place you belong is on our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll treat you nicely!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is it...\NLet's go forward into the future again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.12,0:22:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,W-W-What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.13,0:22:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.30,0:22:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a woman's voice...\Nscreaming for help...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.65,0:23:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oden's great adventure begins!\NMeeting new people, facing challenges!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He travels across an unknown world\Nbeyond his wildest imagination!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.99,0:23:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The story of the troublemaker Oden instantly\Nbecomes known across the world,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and finally comes to this man's knowledge!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.43,0:23:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Whitebeard's Little Brother! Oden's Great Adventure!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.08,0:23:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
